        "type": "section",
        "heading": "Three chords in time",
        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the metronome at {{=bpm}}. After a bar of count-in, the lit box shows the chord to play. Strum down on every beat, one bar for each chord.\nPractice until the shape moves to the next chord without your hand opening up."
          },
