            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the backing track, and follow the tab. Each bar is one chord: the whole chord on beat 1, its root alone on beat 2, its 5th alone on beat 3, and the whole chord again on beat 4.\nKeep the shape held down for the whole bar, so the single notes are already under your fingers."
